	LUNAR LANDER MEMORY MAP
	
	
0-FF	ZERO PAGE RAM	(PAGE ONE MAPPED HERE) READ/WRITE
2000	INPUT (READ ONLY) D0=VECTOR GENERATOR HALT (1=HALT)
			  D1=SELF TEST SWITCH (0=TRUE)
			  D2=SLAM SWITCH  (0=TRUE)
			  D6=3 KHZ SQUARE WAVE
			  D7=DIAG STEP SWITCH (0=TRUE)
2400	START SWITCH D7 (1=TRUE) READ ONLY
2401	COIN MECH #3 D7 (1=TRUE) READ ONLY
2402	COIN MECH #2 D7 (1=TRUE) READ ONLY
2403	COIN MECH #1 D7 (1=TRUE) READ ONLY
2404	GAME SELECT D7 (1=TRUE) READ ONLY
2405	ABORT SWITCH D7 (1=TRUE) READ ONLY
2406	ROTATE RIGHT D7 (1=TRUE) READ ONLY
2407	ROTATE LEFT  D7 (1=TRUE) READ ONLY
2800	OPTION SWITCHES 2,1 (D1,D0) COIN MODES (900,750,600,450) READ ONLY
2801	OPTION SWITCHES 4,3 (D1,D0) D0=FREE PLAY (0=TRUE) READ ONLY
2802	OPTION SWITCHES 6,5 (D1,D0) FOREIGN LANG (GERMAN,SPANISH,FRENCH,ENGLISH)2803	OPTION SWITCHES 8,7 (D1,D0) CRED/COIN MECH #2 (6,5,4,1) READ ONLY
2C00	POT READING (D7-D0) READ ONLY
3000	VECTOR GENERATOR START WRITE ONLY
3200	D3-D0 OPTION LEDS (1=ON) WRITE ONLY
	D4    START & SELECT LEDS (0=ON) WRITE ONLY
	D5    COIN COUNTER (1=ON) WRITE ONLY
3400	WATCHDOG CLEAR WRITE ONLY	
3800	VECTOR GENERATOR CONTINUE WRITE ONLY
3C00	D2-D0 NOISE INTENSITY (111=MAX) WRITE ONLY
	D3    NOISE PITCH (0=THRUST,1=CRASH) WRITE ONLY
	D5-D4 TONES (1=ON) (D5=HIGH,D4=LOW) WRITE ONLY
3E00	NOISE RESET
4000-47FF VECTOR GENERATOR RAM READ/WRITE
4800-5FFF VECTOR GENERATOR ROM READ/WRITE
6000-7FFF PROGRAM ROM
